<https://w3id.org/mado#CFG-RC4-03> <https://w3id.org/mado#origemDoRegistro> "CONFIGURACAO_MATURA_RC4" .
<https://w3id.org/mado#CFG-RC4-03> <https://w3id.org/mado#possuiAplicacaoDeCriterio> <https://w3id.org/mado#APL-CFG-RC4-03-01> .
