<https://w3id.org/mado#CFG-RC4-07> <https://w3id.org/mado#possuiAplicacaoDeCriterio> <https://w3id.org/mado#APL-CFG-RC4-07-01> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#CFG-RC4-07> <https://w3id.org/mado#possuiAplicacaoDeCriterio> <https://w3id.org/mado#APL-CFG-RC4-07-02> .
