<https://w3id.org/mado#K35> <https://w3id.org/mado#aplicavelANecessidade> <https://w3id.org/mado#NEC-COORDENAR-AUTORIA-COLABORATIVA> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#K35> <https://w3id.org/mado#aplicavelANecessidade> <https://w3id.org/mado#NEC-PRESERVAR-PROTAGONISMO> .
